<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφρον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compass in thought, speculate about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἥλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					225
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πράγματα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				741
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>contemn, despise</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δαιμόνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.71
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					372b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πιθανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact. Praef.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., of diseases or difficult patients,
			<i>defy</i> remedies, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.8
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				4.5.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be very thoughtful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ περιφρονοῦσα ἡλικία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					365b
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.).</div>
